Association EdFi.StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation additions
    date Grade09Entry
        documentation "This field holds the date when a student entered the ninth grade."
        is optional
    date PostSecondarySignedPlanDate
        documentation "The postsecondary plans' most recent update and signature date."
        is optional
    descriptor DentalExaminationVerificationCode
        documentation "This code for the dental examination performed."
        is optional
    descriptor MilitaryFamily
        documentation "Indicator to identify the military stuats of the student's family"
        is optional
    descriptor GenderIdentity
        documentation "Indicates the gender the student identifies with."
        is optional
    common extension EdFi.StudentCharacteristic
        documentation "Additional field to record Level of Integration for Gifted Students"
        is optional collection
        
